Hey there everyone! Thanks to your feedback we've updated and improved some aspects of the gameplay, so thank you for that. More specifically, with update version 1.0.4 we have:

- Improved the camera in certain sections of the game;

- Improved Ashlyn's movement and control responsiveness;

- Tweaked the combat system, with the most distinct aspect being the dodge mechanic;

- Save System improvement. Please delete old Save Games.

- An array of minor bug fixes and environment tweaks.

Thank you all for your support, and  keep playing HUSH!

GS78

